{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing puzzle city builder where you expand colonies on all sides of asteroids. Balance three core stats while placing buildings with proximity synergies. Plan efficient layouts, build train networks, and watch your settlements bloom in space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD SMART</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/8d8b651569d26a009de45ef7e1884000.poster.avif?t=1770054393\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/8d8b651569d26a009de45ef7e1884000.webm?t=1770054393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/8d8b651569d26a009de45ef7e1884000.mp4?t=1770054393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildings gain different costs and rewards depending on what surrounds them. Maximize their effectiveness while keeping your resources steady for future moves. Reach score milestones to earn new building choices and keep expanding your colony. Plan efficient layouts shaped by each procedurally generated asteroid and its unique resource distribution.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE TRAIN ROUTES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/9a9afc57e5cecc580de01908fca9ce1b.poster.avif?t=1770054393\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/9a9afc57e5cecc580de01908fca9ce1b.webm?t=1770054393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/9a9afc57e5cecc580de01908fca9ce1b.mp4?t=1770054393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you connect two stations, they collect points from every building within their range - this is then multiplied by total connected stations. Plan your rail network carefully and pick the right moment to trigger satisfying score bursts when everything lines up just right.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE EXPEDITION OBJECTIVES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/48351c102a53d6b6a13068a4e42b46e4.poster.avif?t=1770054393\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/48351c102a53d6b6a13068a4e42b46e4.webm?t=1770054393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/48351c102a53d6b6a13068a4e42b46e4.mp4?t=1770054393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete objectives to advance your expedition, unlock new buildings and explore different asteroid types. Push your scores higher and see how you compare with other players on the leaderboard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GROW YOUR COLONY</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/3b5a68c0b68972f569cfefd1363bc40b.poster.avif?t=1770054393\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/3b5a68c0b68972f569cfefd1363bc40b.webm?t=1770054393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/3b5a68c0b68972f569cfefd1363bc40b.mp4?t=1770054393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every asteroid in AstroScaper is a tiny, unique world with its own layout and challenges. Enjoy soothing, stylized cosmic scenery as you build across randomly generated environments waiting to be transformed into thriving colonies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FREEBUILD MODE</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero pressure, just pure creativity. Build freely without score limits, choose your favorite biome, and shape cozy asteroid colonies at your own pace. Switch to Photo Mode anytime to capture your space settlements from perfect angles.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>AstroScaper is crafted by a two-person team. Inspired by minimalist city-builders like Islanders, it offers a similar pace and aesthetic while introducing new mechanics enabled by its sci-fi setting.<br>We\u2019re pouring our hearts into this little universe and welcome you along for the journey. Feel free to share feedback and ideas!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579350?t=1770054393","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/5afc890301f10c3e851d83a3c09926cc43b28c4c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770054393","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/6354bd7100fbd8e28349fa40ebfe97986dda6de6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770054393","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/6354bd7100fbd8e28349fa40ebfe97986dda6de6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770054393","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4039580,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing puzzle city builder where you expand colonies on all sides of asteroids. Balance three core stats while placing buildings with proximity synergies. Plan efficient layouts, build train networks, and watch your settlements bloom in space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD SMART</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/8d8b651569d26a009de45ef7e1884000.poster.avif?t=1770054393\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/8d8b651569d26a009de45ef7e1884000.webm?t=1770054393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/8d8b651569d26a009de45ef7e1884000.mp4?t=1770054393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildings gain different costs and rewards depending on what surrounds them. Maximize their effectiveness while keeping your resources steady for future moves. Reach score milestones to earn new building choices and keep expanding your colony. Plan efficient layouts shaped by each procedurally generated asteroid and its unique resource distribution.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE TRAIN ROUTES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/9a9afc57e5cecc580de01908fca9ce1b.poster.avif?t=1770054393\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/9a9afc57e5cecc580de01908fca9ce1b.webm?t=1770054393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/9a9afc57e5cecc580de01908fca9ce1b.mp4?t=1770054393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you connect two stations, they collect points from every building within their range - this is then multiplied by total connected stations. Plan your rail network carefully and pick the right moment to trigger satisfying score bursts when everything lines up just right.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE EXPEDITION OBJECTIVES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/48351c102a53d6b6a13068a4e42b46e4.poster.avif?t=1770054393\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/48351c102a53d6b6a13068a4e42b46e4.webm?t=1770054393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/48351c102a53d6b6a13068a4e42b46e4.mp4?t=1770054393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete objectives to advance your expedition, unlock new buildings and explore different asteroid types. Push your scores higher and see how you compare with other players on the leaderboard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GROW YOUR COLONY</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/3b5a68c0b68972f569cfefd1363bc40b.poster.avif?t=1770054393\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/3b5a68c0b68972f569cfefd1363bc40b.webm?t=1770054393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/3b5a68c0b68972f569cfefd1363bc40b.mp4?t=1770054393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every asteroid in AstroScaper is a tiny, unique world with its own layout and challenges. Enjoy soothing, stylized cosmic scenery as you build across randomly generated environments waiting to be transformed into thriving colonies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FREEBUILD MODE</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero pressure, just pure creativity. Build freely without score limits, choose your favorite biome, and shape cozy asteroid colonies at your own pace. Switch to Photo Mode anytime to capture your space settlements from perfect angles.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>AstroScaper is crafted by a two-person team. Inspired by minimalist city-builders like Islanders, it offers a similar pace and aesthetic while introducing new mechanics enabled by its sci-fi setting.<br>We\u2019re pouring our hearts into this little universe and welcome you along for the journey. Feel free to share feedback and ideas!</i></p>","developers":["Fun Fortress"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/4ad849f27b9fd8620e4ca07112d3443188c82751/header.jpg?t=1770054393","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3579350/176346011/e0d7cbe356c2a03251d4b7245a170737a09e6a86/1757092090/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757094636","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3579350/176346011/e0d7cbe356c2a03251d4b7245a170737a09e6a86/1757092090/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757094636","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3579350/176346011/e0d7cbe356c2a03251d4b7245a170737a09e6a86/1757092090/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757094636","id":257191047,"name":"AstroScaper Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257191047/b4786740520417469828d10f681667c2dc3d5955/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757094636"}],"name":"AstroScaper","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 560 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 3.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Fun Fortress"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Q2 2026"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cCute city builder with excellent aesthetics that convey a sense of serenity to the player\u201d<br />\r\nDevGAMM Awards Judge 6 (we owe you cookies!)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cThis game had me hooked! The ambient soundtrack, the space atmosphere, very well done to the creators for making something so peaceful and flow-state inducing!\u201d<br />\r\nDevGAMM Awards Judge 14 (we owe you cookies!)<br />\r\n","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/60263d113a6b8a59da5dacb5c3061425c3e8d8c6/ss_60263d113a6b8a59da5dacb5c3061425c3e8d8c6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770054393","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/60263d113a6b8a59da5dacb5c3061425c3e8d8c6/ss_60263d113a6b8a59da5dacb5c3061425c3e8d8c6.600x338.jpg?t=1770054393"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com